How to run the game
Install the JDK (Java Development Kit).

Save the code in a file named BikeRacing.java.

Open a terminal in that folder.

Compile and run:


bash
javac BikeRacing.java
java BikeRacing
Controls
Left arrow (←): Move the bike left.

Right arrow (→): Move the bike right.

Enter: Restart after a crash.

The game uses Java Swing, so you don't need any external game libraries.


